    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 5310,
      "end_ms": 7750,
      "text": "我都要用用用一些隐喻来来讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 8570,
      "end_ms": 10070,
      "text": "以相论怎么礼法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 10070,
      "end_ms": 11870,
      "text": "就是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 12940,
      "end_ms": 14500,
      "text": "把这些放出来给你们看啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 16219,
      "end_ms": 21150,
      "text": "这个先搞个八卦吧啊先搞个八卦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 22670,
      "end_ms": 24260,
      "text": "这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 28480,
      "end_ms": 30080,
      "text": "只是我们已经做了的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 30080,
      "end_ms": 32430,
      "text": "这些都是我们已经做了的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 32430,
      "end_ms": 36070,
      "text": "你像那你这就是先天卦象啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 36070,
      "end_ms": 39160,
      "text": "你这是八卦先天卦象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 40600,
      "end_ms": 44340,
      "text": "也就乾坤坎离震兑什么啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 44340,
      "end_ms": 45960,
      "text": "耿勋啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 48820,
      "end_ms": 50180,
      "text": "郑对勋更啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 50180,
      "end_ms": 51580,
      "text": "更住了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 52480,
      "end_ms": 54320,
      "text": "不是玄学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 54320,
      "end_ms": 56920,
      "text": "这是这只是说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 64179,
      "end_ms": 66319,
      "text": "呃向天向地啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 66319,
      "end_ms": 67859,
      "text": "像水像火的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 67859,
      "end_ms": 69620,
      "text": "这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 76280,
      "end_ms": 79400,
      "text": "相当于把我们的发展就分成这些部门啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 79400,
      "end_ms": 81520,
      "text": "分成这些分支啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 82320,
      "end_ms": 84420,
      "text": "那对应的就是乾卦天"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 84420,
      "end_ms": 86640,
      "text": "那就是讲究四大公正"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 86640,
      "end_ms": 89150,
      "text": "那我们也做了相应的这个模拟"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 89150,
      "end_ms": 91750,
      "text": "相应的我们自己能做的工作啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 91750,
      "end_ms": 92550,
      "text": "模拟法庭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 92550,
      "end_ms": 93630,
      "text": "还有这个法律援助"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 93630,
      "end_ms": 96000,
      "text": "法律援助的话是对一线劳动者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 96000,
      "end_ms": 98280,
      "text": "线下一线劳动者啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 98280,
      "end_ms": 101440,
      "text": "线下的一线劳动者培训部内的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 101490,
      "end_ms": 106330,
      "text": "然后这个就刚刚那个视频讲过了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 106330,
      "end_ms": 109060,
      "text": "就不多介绍了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 110900,
      "end_ms": 112940,
      "text": "这个我们会做的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 112940,
      "end_ms": 115420,
      "text": "尽量会把它做的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 116680,
      "end_ms": 119220,
      "text": "一有板有眼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 119220,
      "end_ms": 120400,
      "text": "有板有眼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 120400,
      "end_ms": 124130,
      "text": "这是说是中国公民能成立国际组织吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 125170,
      "end_ms": 127750,
      "text": "或许可以吧啊就我想个办法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 127750,
      "end_ms": 132749,
      "text": "就是说搞一个这个嗯模拟劳工仲裁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 132749,
      "end_ms": 134570,
      "text": "或者说是什么呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 134570,
      "end_ms": 136770,
      "text": "缺席审判劳动仲裁啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 136770,
      "end_ms": 141120,
      "text": "当然母国豁免不会搞这么一个啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 141120,
      "end_ms": 143020,
      "text": "劳动仲裁方面的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 143020,
      "end_ms": 147320,
      "text": "现在目前就是全球没有一个什么法庭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 147320,
      "end_ms": 149000,
      "text": "叫劳工仲裁法庭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 149000,
      "end_ms": 150080,
      "text": "没有啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 150080,
      "end_ms": 153650,
      "text": "那么这个东西就天天天到天上去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 153650,
      "end_ms": 155650,
      "text": "然后第二个就是这个坤卦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 155650,
      "end_ms": 160550,
      "text": "坤卦的话他讲的是这个基层兜底啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 160550,
      "end_ms": 164450,
      "text": "这个我们你像你的是帝大地"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 164450,
      "end_ms": 169829,
      "text": "承载这个人们的后路啊和保障"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 169829,
      "end_ms": 171769,
      "text": "那么主要通过质地所"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 171769,
      "end_ms": 175589,
      "text": "还有在教育层面是靠小屋"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 178100,
      "end_ms": 180420,
      "text": "啊就是随便靠的是小屋"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 184520,
      "end_ms": 187780,
      "text": "然后第三个就是水啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 187780,
      "end_ms": 192540,
      "text": "水那么水的话就是代表就是坎卦嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 192540,
      "end_ms": 195320,
      "text": "坎代表是困难陷下去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 195320,
      "end_ms": 196320,
      "text": "难干的事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 196320,
      "end_ms": 198810,
      "text": "难做的事啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 198810,
      "end_ms": 202080,
      "text": "难做的难干的事啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 202080,
      "end_ms": 203540,
      "text": "某些势力不便于做"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 203540,
      "end_ms": 204800,
      "text": "不想做啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 204800,
      "end_ms": 205660,
      "text": "不愿意做"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 205660,
      "end_ms": 208250,
      "text": "甚至带有敌视的事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 208250,
      "end_ms": 209210,
      "text": "我们在做啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 210329,
      "end_ms": 212729,
      "text": "当然说我们知道这个法律底线啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 212729,
      "end_ms": 213589,
      "text": "不能容公"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 213589,
      "end_ms": 216049,
      "text": "不能到下场去进行生产破坏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 216989,
      "end_ms": 218370,
      "text": "要讲大局"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 225590,
      "end_ms": 226510,
      "text": "工人俱乐部的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 226510,
      "end_ms": 230430,
      "text": "目前培训部勉强能算工人俱乐部俱乐部吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 230430,
      "end_ms": 232050,
      "text": "不太算得上啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 232050,
      "end_ms": 235600,
      "text": "就是啊这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 237000,
      "end_ms": 239770,
      "text": "那有雏形啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 239770,
      "end_ms": 240550,
      "text": "那有雏形"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 240550,
      "end_ms": 242450,
      "text": "那么这些东西都是地上建筑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 243570,
      "end_ms": 245270,
      "text": "地上建筑啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 245270,
      "end_ms": 246630,
      "text": "你想你你想查"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 246630,
      "end_ms": 249090,
      "text": "你想逮人很难很困难"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 249090,
      "end_ms": 251710,
      "text": "然后这个第四卦是这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 251710,
      "end_ms": 254770,
      "text": "反正这些东西呢在我看来都是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 254770,
      "end_ms": 256750,
      "text": "某些势力做的不太够的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 256750,
      "end_ms": 258269,
      "text": "反正我们都想办法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 258269,
      "end_ms": 263335,
      "text": "都是至少按照我们的努力去趟出一条路出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 270940,
      "end_ms": 276770,
      "text": "咳第四卦是这个离卦离火啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 276770,
      "end_ms": 280789,
      "text": "离卦的话主要就是说啊焚烧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 281189,
      "end_ms": 285109,
      "text": "然后是非常就就是兴旺旺盛啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 285109,
      "end_ms": 286869,
      "text": "非常靓丽"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 288180,
      "end_ms": 290020,
      "text": "然后我写的是对敌破坏啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 290020,
      "end_ms": 291580,
      "text": "实际上没那么大的本事啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 291580,
      "end_ms": 293140,
      "text": "这顶多是揭露啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 293140,
      "end_ms": 301110,
      "text": "啊对揭露做的就是主要是对一些有损啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 301110,
      "end_ms": 305090,
      "text": "无产阶级长远利益的团体进行披露啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 307240,
      "end_ms": 311280,
      "text": "这个事情呢实事求是讲啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 311280,
      "end_ms": 315140,
      "text": "实事求强也是就是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 316460,
      "end_ms": 319600,
      "text": "哎呀我现在做的也是不到位啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 319600,
      "end_ms": 321990,
      "text": "那我们是做了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 322830,
      "end_ms": 328780,
      "text": "然后这工作呢其实啊我们做的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 328780,
      "end_ms": 330120,
      "text": "我们的力量很有限"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 330120,
      "end_ms": 331220,
      "text": "我们力量非常有限"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 331220,
      "end_ms": 333800,
      "text": "我们能做的就非常非常有限的事情了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 333800,
      "end_ms": 335890,
      "text": "然后呢是这个震卦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 335890,
      "end_ms": 338130,
      "text": "震卦就是雷啊啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 338130,
      "end_ms": 340710,
      "text": "雷声轰隆轰隆阵阵响呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 340710,
      "end_ms": 343510,
      "text": "那么然后是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 346190,
      "end_ms": 347910,
      "text": "啊比较具有那种杀伤力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 347910,
      "end_ms": 350370,
      "text": "破坏力的主要就是说国际公约啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 350370,
      "end_ms": 352330,
      "text": "我们自诩在参加国际公约"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 352330,
      "end_ms": 354150,
      "text": "那么承担一些海外联络"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 354150,
      "end_ms": 356889,
      "text": "还有一个是什么啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 356889,
      "end_ms": 358049,
      "text": "ACA啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 358049,
      "end_ms": 360380,
      "text": "反殖民警戒这方面的工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 360380,
      "end_ms": 364460,
      "text": "那么这个工作的话我们是付出了很大的努力啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 364460,
      "end_ms": 368020,
      "text": "很大的一个心力的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 369300,
      "end_ms": 372360,
      "text": "这些都是你作为一个中国公民"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 372360,
      "end_ms": 376929,
      "text": "老实说都是可以使合法去做的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 377030,
      "end_ms": 378830,
      "text": "就是不做呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 378830,
      "end_ms": 380190,
      "text": "就是有的人只想骂呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 380190,
      "end_ms": 381230,
      "text": "只想批评啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 381230,
      "end_ms": 382549,
      "text": "不想做事情啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 382549,
      "end_ms": 384789,
      "text": "然后那个是兑卦啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 384789,
      "end_ms": 389489,
      "text": "兑兑卦的话就是对者说也说服的说啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 389489,
      "end_ms": 390820,
      "text": "说服的说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 390820,
      "end_ms": 393800,
      "text": "那么它代表的是一种通达"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 393800,
      "end_ms": 396960,
      "text": "也就是思想念头上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 396960,
      "end_ms": 399950,
      "text": "想法上去把它梳理澄清"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 399950,
      "end_ms": 401190,
      "text": "流淌起来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 401190,
      "end_ms": 402630,
      "text": "那就是舆论工作啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 402630,
      "end_ms": 403550,
      "text": "或者思想工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 403550,
      "end_ms": 404550,
      "text": "思想舆论工作的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 404550,
      "end_ms": 407590,
      "text": "我们有这个再理智也有风波啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 407590,
      "end_ms": 410670,
      "text": "这些咨询报告可以来阅读"
