      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 773050,
      "end_ms": 775620,
      "text": "这个什么乾坤坎离正对熏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 775620,
      "end_ms": 777260,
      "text": "干这个这玩意是忽悠人的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 265,
      "start_ms": 777260,
      "end_ms": 779580,
      "text": "反正就是说只要看右边就行了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 266,
      "start_ms": 779580,
      "end_ms": 780980,
      "text": "左边那是忽悠人的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 267,
      "start_ms": 780980,
      "end_ms": 782540,
      "text": "方便过审"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 268,
      "start_ms": 784360,
      "end_ms": 785620,
      "text": "谁垄断了谁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 269,
      "start_ms": 785620,
      "end_ms": 786200,
      "text": "谁垄断了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 270,
      "start_ms": 786200,
      "end_ms": 787080,
      "text": "你还问我吗"
