    {
      "ordinal": 271,
      "start_ms": 787080,
      "end_ms": 788480,
      "text": "你不知道谁垄断了吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 272,
      "start_ms": 788480,
      "end_ms": 790320,
      "text": "你要问我吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 273,
      "start_ms": 796440,
      "end_ms": 800340,
      "text": "那么我们会把这些工作额"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 274,
      "start_ms": 800340,
      "end_ms": 803640,
      "text": "就是全方位的去推进巩固"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 275,
      "start_ms": 804290,
      "end_ms": 808410,
      "text": "然后很多东西都是有的是花钱的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 276,
      "start_ms": 808410,
      "end_ms": 810070,
      "text": "是不花钱的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 277,
      "start_ms": 810070,
      "end_ms": 813290,
      "text": "变就不是它里面完全是不讲经济的逻辑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 278,
      "start_ms": 813290,
      "end_ms": 814910,
      "text": "不讲这个钱的逻辑的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 279,
      "start_ms": 814910,
      "end_ms": 820170,
      "text": "这些都是you the political这个effort"
